{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S05少了Y对“心里空落落”的直接交代，S13也弱化了“谁也没法答应永远”这一关键心理认知，个别转折不如Y直白。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的加亮短语让观众不用读完每句话就能抓住心理重点，话与感受交替也比Y左右两栏同时堆叠信息更容易扫读。更重要的是，X的感受按照音乐节点分批出现，能看到从心动、犹豫、沉醉到不安、释然的细微变化，水波、船、光线和声音等意象也形成了连续的感官线索。Y的心理叙述有些地方更直白完整，但感受词之间较容易成为并列清单，音乐与文字的细节对应、情绪推进的层次感都不如X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "376cf9dd-9d7a-41f0-ac73-9e5fe37de0b4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T054015281370Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:41:13.495904+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f77d92642886e776ad493eeee83bc6e396853e666699fa3a42c4afdd3771283b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we